## ObjectType: Response Event

Local operational object; source concept reference does not assert OWL equivalence.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| event_id | Event id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | event_id |
| name | Name | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| response_date | Response date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | response_date |
| block_code | Block code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | block_code |
| duration_hours | Duration hours | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | duration_hours |
| target_kw | Target kw | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | target_kw |
| priority | Priority | integer | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | priority |
| reward_cny_kwh | Reward cny kwh | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | reward_cny_kwh |
| minimum_ratio | Minimum ratio | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | minimum_ratio |
| status | Status | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | status |
| status_code | Status code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | status_code |
| announced_date | Announced date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | announced_date |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | known_date |

